# Vymotion Worker — local dev secrets.
# Copy to `.dev.vars` and fill in. NEVER commit the real .dev.vars (it's gitignored).
# In production these are set with `wrangler secret put <NAME>`.
# Full list mirrors PRD Appendix C.

# ── Higgsfield Platform API (image/video) — server-side only ──
HF_API_KEY=""
HF_API_SECRET=""
HF_WEBHOOK_SECRET=""

# ── Anthropic Claude (prompt intelligence) ──
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=""

# ── Polar.sh (Merchant of Record: billing + webhooks) ──
POLAR_ACCESS_TOKEN=""
POLAR_WEBHOOK_SECRET=""

# ── Clerk (identity/sessions/social login) ──
CLERK_SECRET_KEY=""
CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=""
CLERK_WEBHOOK_SECRET=""
